# GitHub and jobs

Read [`docs/adr/0005-github-source-of-truth.md`](../../docs/adr/0005-github-source-of-truth.md)
and [`docs/adr/0006-postgres-jobs.md`](../../docs/adr/0006-postgres-jobs.md).

- Verify webhook signatures before any write.
- GitHub is authoritative for reviews and checks. Do not invent in-app scoring.
- Jobs live in PostgreSQL via `src/infrastructure/jobs`. Do not add Redis.
- `processDelivery` currently marks a delivery processed. Full PR/review/check
  sync is not implemented yet.
- Worker loop: `src/worker.ts`. One-shot enqueue: `src/reconcile.ts`.
